{"3204620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tellus: Echo of the Void", "steam_appid": 3204620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tellus: Echo of the Void</strong> is a sci-fi game about survival, exploration, and terraforming on a hostile planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build your own base, craft machines, and slowly transform a dead world around you. As you progress, you will unlock new technologies, explore abandoned facilities, caves, and outposts, and face dangerous natural and cosmic events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version already includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >terraforming up to <strong>Level 9</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier 1–3</strong> technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>caves, outposts, and points of interest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >base building and infrastructure progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meteor storms and other threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies will clear, rain will fall, lakes will form, the surface will begin to turn green, and eventually you will see the first grass growing on Tellus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Are you ready to leave your mark on Tellus?</strong><br><strong>The Echo of the Void is waiting for you.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tellus: Echo of the Void</strong> is a sci-fi game about survival, exploration, and terraforming on a hostile planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build your own base, craft machines, and slowly transform a dead world around you. As you progress, you will unlock new technologies, explore abandoned facilities, caves, and outposts, and face dangerous natural and cosmic events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version already includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >terraforming up to <strong>Level 9</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tier 1–3</strong> technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>caves, outposts, and points of interest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >base building and infrastructure progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meteor storms and other threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies will clear, rain will fall, lakes will form, the surface will begin to turn green, and eventually you will see the first grass growing on Tellus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Are you ready to leave your mark on Tellus?</strong><br><strong>The Echo of the Void is waiting for you.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Explore, survive, and terraform a barren artificial world. Build your base, reshape the environment, and uncover the hidden purpose of Tellus as life slowly begins to emerge.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204620/5966da70a7d4574c8a87151c08aca7c57bcb7ecf/header.jpg?t=1788286695", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204620/1cc52f51e583fd628ae0822955ced470b895828b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788286695", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204620/1cc52f51e583fd628ae0822955ced470b895828b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788286695", "website": "https://nightwolfgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4430 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong